{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-034",
    "title": "归墟盟主"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_203",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“找到之后呢？”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "陆照临进入天门后，玄霄宗的山门内战开始了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6068,
          "end": 6068
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "掌门闭关未出，九位长老在议事殿分成两列。左列主张立即关闭天门，右列主张趁门缝尚未稳定时进入其中，夺回被太虚遗脉吸收的残印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6070,
          "end": 6070
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“持印者已经进入门内。”守门长老说，“若不封门，灵脉会继续倒灌。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6072,
          "end": 6072
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封门便等于放弃两枚残印。”开门长老反驳，“三百年前的封存工程已经证明，太虚遗脉无法被永久压制。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6074,
          "end": 6074
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "议事殿中央摆着一只黑漆木盒。盒盖上刻着陆照临的名字，名字旁边有一道被削去的空白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6076,
          "end": 6076
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋站在殿外，没有人邀请她入席。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6078,
          "end": 6078
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她参与过三年前的点灯。”一名长老说，“证词应当公开。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6080,
          "end": 6080
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她只是外门执事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6082,
          "end": 6082
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“外门执事没有资格接触第三盏灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6084,
          "end": 6084
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋推门进入：“那就说明宗门的记录一直在撒谎。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6086,
          "end": 6086
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "所有人转头看她。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6088,
          "end": 6088
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“沈砚秋，你可知擅闯议事殿的罪名？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6090,
          "end": 6090
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6092,
          "end": 6092
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你还敢来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6094,
          "end": 6094
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为你们要用我的证词决定关门还是开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6096,
          "end": 6096
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把一张折叠的纸放在桌上。纸上写着雪原点灯记录，落款是她自己的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6098,
          "end": 6098
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前冬至前七日，我在雪原点亮第三盏灯。陆沉舟把灯交给我，要求我把它带回玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6100,
          "end": 6100
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你没有带回。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6102,
          "end": 6102
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为灯火中出现了天门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6104,
          "end": 6104
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你为什么隐瞒？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6106,
          "end": 6106
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为我看见门里的人没有名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6108,
          "end": 6108
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守门长老拍桌：“这不是理由。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6110,
          "end": 6110
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那我再说一个理由。”沈砚秋抬头，“当时下令删史的人，就坐在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6112,
          "end": 6112
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "殿中一阵骚动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6114,
          "end": 6114
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "九位长老互相看着，没有人承认。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6116,
          "end": 6116
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "开门长老冷声道：“旧事与今日无关。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6118,
          "end": 6118
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“今日的天门就是旧事留下的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6120,
          "end": 6120
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把证词翻到背面。背面还有一段被火燎过的文字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6122,
          "end": 6122
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“若第三盏灯再次点亮，玄霄宗必须选择守门或开门。守门者失去灵脉，开门者失去名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6124,
          "end": 6124
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是你写的？”守门长老问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6126,
          "end": 6126
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是我从陆沉舟手里抄下的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6128,
          "end": 6128
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你当时为何不呈报？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6130,
          "end": 6130
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为呈报之后，纸会被裁掉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6132,
          "end": 6132
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "议事殿外突然传来钟声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6134,
          "end": 6134
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "玄霄宗山门九盏灯同时熄灭，唯独钟楼顶端的空灯亮起青火。火焰照出一条通往天门的影子，影子里站着陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6136,
          "end": 6136
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守门长老拔剑：“他正在返回。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6138,
          "end": 6138
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那不是返回。”沈砚秋说，“是门把他的影子送回来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6140,
          "end": 6140
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "影子走进议事殿，停在黑漆木盒前。木盒上的名字开始变化，陆照临三个字逐渐褪色，露出下面另一行：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6142,
          "end": 6142
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“持印者，暂代门楔。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6144,
          "end": 6144
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "开门长老伸手去抓木盒。影子抬起手，议事殿所有灯盏同时碎裂。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6146,
          "end": 6146
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“门楔不能被任何一方带走。”沈砚秋说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6148,
          "end": 6148
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你想保护陆照临？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6150,
          "end": 6150
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“沈执事！”守门弟子喊，“你站哪一边？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6176,
          "end": 6176
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“站在还记得的人这一边。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6178,
          "end": 6178
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她将证词举过头顶，声音传遍宗门：“三年前，玄霄宗、顾氏、归墟盟共同封存灵脉城。封存不是胜利，只是把代价推给后来的人。今天，谁要关门，先说出自己愿意留下谁；谁要开门，也先说出自己愿意失去谁。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6180,
          "end": 6180
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "没有人回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6182,
          "end": 6182
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "山门九盏灯重新亮起，灯火却各自朝不同方向倾斜。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6184,
          "end": 6184
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天门内传来陆照临的声音：“沈砚秋，别替我作证。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6186,
          "end": 6186
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她抬头：“我不是替你作证。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6188,
          "end": 6188
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你在做什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6190,
          "end": 6190
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“替所有被删掉的人，留下一个可以被质疑的记录。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6192,
          "end": 6192
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天门影子骤然扩大，覆盖整个钟楼。玄霄宗两派弟子被迫停手，所有人都看见黑暗中的陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6194,
          "end": 6194
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他站在陆照临身后，手里提着一盏空灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6196,
          "end": 6196
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“守门派会失去灵脉。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6198,
          "end": 6198
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还有第三条路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6202,
          "end": 6202
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“责任不等于权力。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6348,
          "end": 6348
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜接过骨牌，指腹在地图门缝上摩挲：“你们内部有人把路线交给了玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6350,
          "end": 6350
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6352,
          "end": 6352
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6354,
          "end": 6354
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6356,
          "end": 6356
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜的脸色变了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6358,
          "end": 6358
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主继续道：“不是你亲自交，但你的旧印被复制过。有人用你的权限打开了归墟盟的路线库。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6360,
          "end": 6360
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你怀疑我？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6362,
          "end": 6362
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我怀疑所有拥有权限的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6364,
          "end": 6364
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以你把我派出来送死？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6366,
          "end": 6366
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我把你派来找持印者。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6368,
          "end": 6368
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“找到之后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6370,
          "end": 6370
        }
      }
    ],
